#!/bin/sh
cat <<'EOF'
Tinfoil debug toolbox

Common commands:
  docker pull <image>
  docker run ...
  docker ps
  docker logs <container>
  docker inspect <container>
  docker exec -it <container> sh
  docker exec <container> nvidia-smi

Helpers:
  tinfoil-containers
  tinfoil-logs <container> [docker logs args...]
  tinfoil-exec <container> [command...]
  tinfoil-nvidia-smi <container>

This shell is inside the toolbox container. Docker socket access intentionally
grants control over workload containers in this debug CVM.
Dropbear listens on port 2222 by default. If the fixed /dev/hvc1 terminal is
present, a persistent unauthenticated BusyBox root toolbox console is also kept
alive there. This toolbox never attaches a shell to /dev/hvc0.
EOF
